{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Onionsan\n🧅 Recurring NPC by Hometown's Lake, with a name inherited directly from Undertale, where he lived in Waterfall.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Normal NPC**\nTakes over his usual meeting spot right after his disappearance, with a line that eerily matches his speech pattern — the basis of the theory (speculative and fairly dark)…","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Lake**\nIs his home and constant meeting spot during the first two chapters, before disappearing entirely.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**What was the song of the sea?**\nOnion's exact line in Ch.2 —\"I've heard that song before... [TODO: verify exact EN quote]","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**What really happened to him?**\nA speculative and fairly macabre theory: that Normal NPC killed him to stop him from investigating that same song, and then sold his remains as food (takoyaki) at the Ch.5 Festival, where Susie comments that…","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Deltarune_-_Sprite_-_Onionsan_-_Kawaii.webp","x":-76,"y":-295,"width":193,"height":190},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Deltarune_-_Sprite_-_Normal_NPC.webp","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Lake.png","x":420,"y":-470,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Clam Guy**\nIn Ch.1, Onionsan is \"the thing\" Clam Guy runs into by the Lake and unintentionally treats badly.","x":760,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"4"},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster_Clam_Guy_overworld.png","x":760,"y":-450,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Onion_screenshot_Chapter_2.png","x":-91,"y":865,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e3_x0","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"}]}